$n = random(2011, 2021, 1);
Context("Percent");
$p = Percent((0.339*($n - 2010) + 28.3)/100);

#############################
# Exercise Group Introduction
#############################

BEGIN_PGML
Since the year 2010, the percent of wealth in the United States that is held by the wealthiest 1% has followed the formula [`p=0.339(n-2010)+28.3`] where [`n`] is the year.

END_PGML

######
# Body
######

BEGIN_PGML
What percent of wealth in the United States was held by the wealthiest 1% in the year [$n]?

[_]{$p}{10}

END_PGML

